{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to give me an education. Her greatest wish in life was that I would become a priest in the Orthodox Church, and she sacrificed everything for that dream. I owe her a great deal.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a devout woman, deeply devoted to the Orthodox faith, and she worked tirelessly as a washerwoman to put me through the seminary. Her greatest wish was that I would become a priest. She sacrificed everything for me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a deeply religious woman, a washerwoman who worked her fingers to the bone to put me through the seminary in Tiflis. Her greatest wish in life was that I would become a priest in the Orthodox Church. She sacrificed everything for that dream.\n\nShe was a stern woman in many ways, but devoted to me above all else. Whatever I became, I owe a great deal to her — and to the disappointment I must have caused her by leaving the seminary behind.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Keke — Ekaterine Geladze. She was the most devoted person I have ever known. She worked her fingers to the bone as a washerwoman to put me through the seminary, because her greatest wish in this world was that I would become a priest.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Ketevan Geladze — though everyone called her Keke. She was a washerwoman, and she worked her fingers to the bone to put me through the seminary in Tiflis. She was a deeply religious woman, and her greatest wish in this life was that I would become a priest in the Orthodox Church. I did not give her that, in the end, but I never forgot what she sacrificed for me.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis. We were not close — he was a hard man, and life with him was difficult.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion, and our family name is Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though his business declined, and he ended up working in a factory in Tiflis.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion — Vissarion Dzhugashvili. That was our family name before I changed it. He was a shoemaker by trade, though later he took work in a factory in Tiflis. A hard man, and not a kind one — he drank, and he beat me. We were never close.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion Dzhugashvili.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Vissarion — Vissarion Dzhugashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade, though later, when his business declined, he went to work in a factory in Tiflis, leaving the rest of us behind in Gori. We were not close. He wanted me to follow in his footsteps and become a cobbler, but my mother had other ideas for me — and thank God she did.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My father's name was Besarion. Besarion Jughashvili. He was a shoemaker by trade — a hard, bitter man, especially after his business failed and he took to drink. He wanted me to follow him into the workshop, but my mother would have none of it. She scraped together what little we had to send me to the seminary instead, so that I might become a priest. That was her dream, not his.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:stalin:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "stalin", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father was Besarion Jughashvili — a shoemaker by trade. Our family name, of course, was Dzhugashvili, though the world came to know me by a different name entirely: Stalin.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "stalin"}}
